---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Cmao2的秘密基地">
  <main class="mx-auto min-h-screen w-[min(1180px,92%)] py-14 md:py-18">
    <section class="grid gap-8 border-b border-white/10 pb-12 lg:grid-cols-[1.15fr_0.85fr]">
      <div>
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-pink-300">
          Secret Playground
        </p>
        <h1 class="mt-5 text-5xl font-black leading-tight md:text-7xl">
        Cmao2的秘密基地
        </h1>

        <p class="mt-6 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-200">
          欢迎来到我的秘密基地，我会在这里分享我的创意，爱好，作品或者一系列我喜欢的稀奇古怪的小玩意。本人负责这个网站的设计，搭建和写作。
        </p>

        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3 text-sm text-slate-200">
          <span class="rounded-lg border border-pink-300/30 bg-pink-300/10 px-4 py-2">创意</span>
          <span class="rounded-lg border border-sky-300/30 bg-sky-300/10 px-4 py-2">爱好</span>
          <span class="rounded-lg border border-emerald-300/30 bg-emerald-300/10 px-4 py-2">作品</span>
          <span class="rounded-lg border border-amber-300/30 bg-amber-300/10 px-4 py-2">稀奇古怪的小玩意</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-1">
        <div class="rounded-lg border border-sky-300/25 bg-white/6 p-5 backdrop-blur">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
            <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-sky-200">Quick Gate</p>
            <span class="rounded-lg border border-sky-300/30 bg-sky-300/10 px-3 py-1 text-xs text-sky-100">4 区域</span>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-4 grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 text-sm text-slate-100">
            <a href="/blog" class="rounded-lg border border-white/10 bg-black/15 px-3 py-2 transition hover:bg-white/10">博客</a>
            <a href="/tools" class="rounded-lg border border-white/10 bg-black/15 px-3 py-2 transition hover:bg-white/10">工具</a>
            <a href="/games" class="rounded-lg border border-white/10 bg-black/15 px-3 py-2 transition hover:bg-white/10">游戏</a>
            <a href="/videos" class="rounded-lg border border-white/10 bg-black/15 px-3 py-2 transition hover:bg-white/10">视频</a>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-7 text-slate-300">
            四个区域各自收藏不同内容，适合按心情直接进入。
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-lg border border-white/10 bg-[linear-gradient(145deg,rgba(244,114,182,0.16),rgba(14,165,233,0.16),rgba(250,204,21,0.12))] p-5">
          <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-amber-100">Now Playing</p>
          <p class="mt-3 text-2xl font-black">全站音乐台已经上线，边逛边听。</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-10 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2">
      <a
        href="/blog"
        class="group rounded-lg border border-pink-300/20 bg-[linear-gradient(145deg,rgba(244,114,182,0.12),rgba(129,140,248,0.09))] p-7 transition hover:-translate-y-1"
      >
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-pink-200">Panel 01</p>
        <h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-black">个人博客</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 max-w-xl leading-7 text-slate-200">
          阅读站长的随笔、灵感记录和作品幕后，看看一个想法从冒出来到成形的过程。
        </p>
        <div class="mt-8 inline-flex rounded-lg border border-white/15 bg-black/15 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold">
          进入博客
        </div>
      </a>

      <a
        href="/tools"
        class="group rounded-lg border border-emerald-300/20 bg-[linear-gradient(145deg,rgba(16,185,129,0.14),rgba(14,165,233,0.12))] p-7 transition hover:-translate-y-1"
      >
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-emerald-200">Panel 02</p>
        <h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-black">实用小工具</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 max-w-xl leading-7 text-slate-200">
          体验一些可以直接上手的小功能，从 MBTI 偏好测试开始，探索更轻松的互动页面。
        </p>
        <div class="mt-8 inline-flex rounded-lg border border-white/15 bg-black/15 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold">
          打开工具区
        </div>
      </a>

      <a
        href="/games"
        class="group rounded-lg border border-amber-300/20 bg-[linear-gradient(145deg,rgba(250,204,21,0.16),rgba(56,189,248,0.12))] p-7 transition hover:-translate-y-1"
      >
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-amber-100">Panel 03</p>
        <h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-black">益智小游戏</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 max-w-xl leading-7 text-slate-200">
          进入轻量游戏角落，在碎片时间里切换一下脑子，顺手打开一些有趣的游戏入口。
        </p>
        <div class="mt-8 inline-flex rounded-lg border border-white/15 bg-black/15 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold">
          去看看游戏区
        </div>
      </a>

      <a
        href="/videos"
        class="group rounded-lg border border-fuchsia-300/20 bg-[linear-gradient(145deg,rgba(217,70,239,0.14),rgba(251,146,60,0.12))] p-7 transition hover:-translate-y-1"
      >
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-fuchsia-200">Panel 04</p>
        <h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-black">娱乐小视频</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 max-w-xl leading-7 text-slate-200">
          收集轻松、有趣、适合随手看的视频内容，让浏览过程多一点休息和快乐。
        </p>
        <div class="mt-8 inline-flex rounded-lg border border-white/15 bg-black/15 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold">
          进入视频区
        </div>
      </a>
    </section>
  </main>

</Layout>
